  "vulnerabilities": "The pro-D coalition has dug in its heels, arguing that for C to be the answer, the test maker would have had to mistakenly believe Hull-House was in Places of Learning despite reading Lee's chapter. Pro-D views this as an impossible mental state for the test maker."
